      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "Duration tokens control how long an interface change takes. They ship from the SOLAR Foundations library — a Web-specific semantic layer (e.g., motion/duration/hover, motion/duration/expand) is a planned next workstream and not yet defined.\n\nUntil that layer lands, reference the primitives directly and follow the per-row guidance below.",
