      "w": 1440,
      "h": 656,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "Easing tokens control the rate of change across the duration. SOLAR Web defaults to ease-out for most UI transitions: motion accelerates quickly and settles naturally.\n\nA semantic layer for direction-specific easings (e.g., motion/ease/enter ↔ out, motion/ease/exit ↔ in) is a planned next workstream.",
          "style": "Body/Body M"
        },
        {
